    "detailed_description": "<strong>Become a shepherd with your trusty dog in the alps!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/ae4530e12080f9ac7ab2729e558790d7.avif?t=1731494957\" width=461 height=259 /></span><br><br><strong>Matthias</strong>, a young shepherd in a rural Austrian town, embarks on a new journey with his loyal canine friend, <strong>Rocky</strong>. They face the challenges of shepherding: training the sheepdogs, herding the sheep, and defending them from wolves. On his journey, Matthias forms new friendships, rekindles old relationships, and even comes across a few rivals. However, he knows Rocky, his trusted friend, stands beside him in every situation, ready to lend a paw. The bond between Matthias and his animal companions forms the heart of this fun role-playing adventure that offers players a chance to experience the beauty of rural life in the Alps and the adventures that come along with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/6d601a843d5ee774211919173f5d0d64.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>Train and play with your dog(s) to make them the best girls and boys! They learn by the way you treat them, making training as realistic as possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.poster.avif?t=1731494957\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.webm?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.mp4?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sophisticated Dog-AI, trained on your level of care and commitment<br></li><li>Make profit on your farm by breeding animals <br></li><li>Compete in Dog and Herding Shows to win the coveted grand prize (during Early Access)<br></li><li>Unlock new dog breeds and customize them with accessories (during Early Access)</li></ul><br>Direct your dog to herd the sheep with an all new herding behavior. The better your companion is trained, the better the sheep follow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.poster.avif?t=1731494957\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.webm?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.mp4?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/17ec2a75ed8cfa92eb1d7caf4c41471a.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>A branching interactive dialogue system as well as a reputation system with every person in town help bring the narrative adventure to life. Some events will only unfold with a person that likes you - others with people who don't.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Branching Dialogue<br></li><li>Fun side stories with the townsfolk based on your reputation<br></li><li>Fully voiced in English and German</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/2cfcb67fcf1f938ab9b56f8790b872ac.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>With a special exploration system you can hike the Austrian Alps and uncover the minor and major legends, like the Mystery of the <strong>Black Sheep</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive exploration to find gifts and more<br></li><li>Hiking system requiring supplies and tools<br></li><li>Tied to the story</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/2f4c4e6db297c2d723980ac128489e6e.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>Need a break from reality? A vacation in the mountains? <strong>The Shepherd: Black Sheep</strong> is designed from the ground up to be a relaxing and cozy experience.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Become a shepherd with your trusty dog in the alps!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/ae4530e12080f9ac7ab2729e558790d7.avif?t=1731494957\" width=461 height=259 /></span><br><br><strong>Matthias</strong>, a young shepherd in a rural Austrian town, embarks on a new journey with his loyal canine friend, <strong>Rocky</strong>. They face the challenges of shepherding: training the sheepdogs, herding the sheep, and defending them from wolves. On his journey, Matthias forms new friendships, rekindles old relationships, and even comes across a few rivals. However, he knows Rocky, his trusted friend, stands beside him in every situation, ready to lend a paw. The bond between Matthias and his animal companions forms the heart of this fun role-playing adventure that offers players a chance to experience the beauty of rural life in the Alps and the adventures that come along with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/6d601a843d5ee774211919173f5d0d64.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>Train and play with your dog(s) to make them the best girls and boys! They learn by the way you treat them, making training as realistic as possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.poster.avif?t=1731494957\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.webm?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/eb5cfbb6d7fc56c9d6a46a77f96c756a.mp4?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sophisticated Dog-AI, trained on your level of care and commitment<br></li><li>Make profit on your farm by breeding animals <br></li><li>Compete in Dog and Herding Shows to win the coveted grand prize (during Early Access)<br></li><li>Unlock new dog breeds and customize them with accessories (during Early Access)</li></ul><br>Direct your dog to herd the sheep with an all new herding behavior. The better your companion is trained, the better the sheep follow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.poster.avif?t=1731494957\" width=720 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.webm?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/47ce45e34b5ac6f5146685b67c19f474.mp4?t=1731494957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/17ec2a75ed8cfa92eb1d7caf4c41471a.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>A branching interactive dialogue system as well as a reputation system with every person in town help bring the narrative adventure to life. Some events will only unfold with a person that likes you - others with people who don't.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Branching Dialogue<br></li><li>Fun side stories with the townsfolk based on your reputation<br></li><li>Fully voiced in English and German</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/2cfcb67fcf1f938ab9b56f8790b872ac.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>With a special exploration system you can hike the Austrian Alps and uncover the minor and major legends, like the Mystery of the <strong>Black Sheep</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive exploration to find gifts and more<br></li><li>Hiking system requiring supplies and tools<br></li><li>Tied to the story</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963930/extras/2f4c4e6db297c2d723980ac128489e6e.avif?t=1731494957\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br>Need a break from reality? A vacation in the mountains? <strong>The Shepherd: Black Sheep</strong> is designed from the ground up to be a relaxing and cozy experience.",
    "short_description": "Delve into The Shepherd: Black sheep for a cozy, alpine Adventure. Play as Matthias and his fluffy friend Rocky and meet the citizens of Hochboden. Train your animals, keep them safe from danger, become a master shepherd and explore the alps! Will you be able to fulfill your family's destiny?",
